{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Python Environments Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Option 1: uv venv (Recommended)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "`uv` is the fastest Python package manager (10-100x faster than pip). It handles virtual environments, Python versions, and dependency resolution in one tool."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv python install 3.12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "cd your-project"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv venv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "source .venv/bin/activate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Install packages:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv pip install torch numpy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Create a project with `pyproject.toml` in one step:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv init my-ai-project"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "cd my-ai-project"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "uv add torch numpy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Option 2: venv (Built-in)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "If you can't install `uv`, Python ships with `venv`:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "python3 -m venv .venv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "source .venv/bin/activate  # Linux/macOS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ".venv\\Scripts\\activate     # Windows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "pip install torch numpy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Slower than `uv`, but works everywhere Python is installed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Option 3: conda (When You Need It)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Conda manages non-Python dependencies like CUDA toolkits, cuDNN, and C libraries. Use it when:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- You need a specific CUDA toolkit version without installing it system-wide"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- You're on a shared cluster where you can't install system packages"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- A library's install instructions say \"use conda\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Install miniconda (not the full Anaconda)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -LsSf https://repo.anaconda.com/miniconda/Miniconda3-latest-Linux-x86_64.sh -o miniconda.sh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "bash miniconda.sh -b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "conda create -n myproject python=3.12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "conda activate myproject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "conda install pytorch pytorch-cuda=12.4 -c pytorch -c nvidia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "One rule: if you use conda for an environment, use conda for all packages in that environment. Mixing `pip install` into a conda env causes dependency conflicts that are painful to debug."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### For This Course: Per-Phase Strategy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "You could create one environment for the whole course. Don't. Different phases need different (sometimes conflicting) dependencies."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Strategy:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "ai-engineering-from-scratch/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u251c\u2500\u2500 .venv/                    <-- shared lightweight env for phases 0-3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u251c\u2500\u2500 phases/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 04-neural-networks/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 .venv/            <-- PyTorch env"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 05-cnns/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 .venv/            <-- same PyTorch env (symlink or shared)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 08-transformers/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 .venv/            <-- might need different transformer versions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 11-llm-apis/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 .venv/            <-- API SDKs, no torch needed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The script in `code/env_setup.sh` creates the base environment for this course."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Run `env_setup.sh` and verify all checks pass\n2. Create a second virtual environment, install a different version of numpy in it, and confirm the two environments are isolated\n3. Write a `pyproject.toml` for a project that needs both PyTorch and the Anthropic SDK\n4. Deliberately install a package globally (without activating a venv), notice where it goes, then uninstall it"
      ]
    }
  ],
